      "concept": "Decision-specific capacity and refusal of elective surgery",
      "stem": "A 61-year-old man declines elective surgery for a symptomatic hernia. BP is 128/82 mm Hg, the hernia is reducible, and he has no obstruction. He accurately explains the options, retains the information and describes why avoiding an operation matters more to him than symptom relief. Which response best respects valid consent?",
