      "stem": "A 16-year-old girl being treated for iron deficiency continues to report fatigue. BP is 108/68 mm Hg, pulse 88/min and ferritin is low. She takes her prescribed iron with strong tea at breakfast every day. Which change best addresses a modifiable absorption issue identified in this history?",
