      "concept": "Applying the Health Belief Model during counselling",
      "stem": "A 46-year-old woman with repeated BP readings near 160/96 mm Hg feels well and declines follow-up. Examination shows no acute illness. She says, “Stroke happens to other people, and I would lose a day's pay coming here.” Which counselling approach most directly addresses the two barriers she identifies?",
