      "stem": "An 8-year-old boy with newly diagnosed diabetes attends an education visit. His glucose is stable, he is alert, and he reads at grade level. During the visit he correctly explains that pouring the same drink from a short cup into a taller one does not change how much it contains. Which approach best builds on the reasoning skill he demonstrates?",
