      "stem": "A 52-year-old woman reports recurrent episodes of joint swelling. She is clinically stable. Her clinic is assessing an initial diagnostic test in comparable patients. Of 70 patients with disease on the reference test, 45 tested positive initially. Of 177 patients without disease, 33 tested positive initially. Among patients who truly have the disease, what percentage will the initial test miss?",
