      "concept": "Separate alveolar ventilation from total minute ventilation",
      "stem": "A 24-year-old man has shallow breathing after surgery. Oxygen saturation is 94% and breath sounds are equal. Measured tidal volume is 320 mL, respiratory rate is 14/min, and measured dead space is 110 mL per breath. Which estimate describes the volume reaching gas-exchanging alveoli each minute?",
