      "stem": "A 34-year-old man is attending a clinic for hypertension. The team reviews systolic blood pressure measurements from comparable patients. In a separate random sample of 25 patients, the mean is 140 mm Hg and the standard deviation is 15 mm Hg. What is the standard error of the mean, rounded to two decimal places if needed?",
